            "id": "part-1-group-1",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–6</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div><strong>Travel Insurance</strong></div><ul><li>Type: {{1}}</li></ul><p>Comprehensive — Section 1: Baggage &amp; Personal Effects</p><ul><li>single {{2}}: $1,500</li><li>cameras and portable electronic {{3}}</li><li>money: ${{4}}</li></ul><p>Section 2: Disrupted Travel</p><ul><li>reasonable {{5}}: $2,500</li><li>missed connections or early return (as verified by the {{6}})</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "part-1-group-2",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 7–8</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 7,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The woman will buy",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "a new motorbike."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "an old car."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "a new car."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 8,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The woman does not want to insure her vehicle with a Multi-saver policy",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "because it has too many conditions."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "because it is rather expensive."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "because it benefits homeowners."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "part-1-group-3",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 9–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 2,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 9,
                "textHtml": "Which <strong>TWO</strong> of the following relate to the Top Cover policy?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "it includes an agreement on the value of a holder's vehicle"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "it covers vehicles of any age"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "there is a stand-down period before it takes effect"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "D",
                    "textHtml": "it covers storm damage"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "E",
                    "textHtml": "it is cheaper than many other policies"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "title": "Part 2",
        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
