                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "has a comprehensive website"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 25,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;A benefit of Rangi's decision is that he will",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "finish his degree earlier."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "receive higher marks."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "improve his writing style."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 26,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The Professor thinks the claims of some lecturers are",
